+      <bpmn:documentation>Same repository: branch from the dependency PR's branch and open a draft PR whose base is that branch; pull the dependency in with merge commits, never rebase or force-push another session's branch. Across layers: develop against the dependency's branch laid over a fresh mount; a draft may pin the dependency PR's full head SHA, never a branch. Write "stacked on &lt;repo&gt;#&lt;n&gt;" in the PR body.</bpmn:documentation>
